#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、このモニター…！
#. どこの会社が作ってるんだよ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What kind of monitor is this!? Who would even make\n"
"this kind of thing!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …モノクマ社って書いてある。
#. ディティールにこだわってるな…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It has \"Monokuma Co.\" written across it. I guess\n"
"they've covered all the details..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. きっと今も、この向こうで…黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now, the mastermind is probably on the other side\n"
"of that surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう思うとムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just thinking about it puts me on edge...but there's\n"
"nothing I can really do about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは、ゴミ箱だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a normal trash can.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>中には何も入ってないし、
#. 気にする必要はないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's nothing inside, so I don't really need to\n"
"spend any more time thinking about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>冷蔵庫…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A refrigerator...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>医薬品でも冷やしてるのかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They must use it to keep drugs and stuff cold.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
